      <gmd:supplementalInformation>
        <gco:CharacterString>This data layer is an output from the solar resource mapping of Zambia by Solargis. It has been delivered for the Energy Sector Management Assistance Program (ESMAP), a global initiative in support of renewable energy resource mapping under a global initiative on Renewable Energy Resource Mapping, administered by The World Bank. The uncertainty of the solar resource data has been reduced by regional model adaptation based on ground measurements collected at three solar meteorological stations across Zambia, funded by The World Bank in years 2015 to 2017.</gco:CharacterString>
